(6397381, 948299, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nicely Done!!!  Don''t hate me, but I''m only saying this because I just finished teaching my photo students about Rule of Thirds, and I would have had her head a rad more to the right of the frame (further away from the middle) Regardless, it''s a Great shot and perfect expression!</td>', 'Nicely Done!!!  Don''t hate me, but I''m only saying this because I just finished teaching my photo students about Rule of Thirds, and I would have had her head a rad more to the right of the frame (further away from the middle) Regardless, it''s a Great shot and perfect expression!', '2011-04-27 18:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6397382, 948258, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I would suggest trying to keep the buildings out of the shot but crouching down a little more and also doing a little cropping on the bottom</td>', 'Great idea, but I would suggest trying to keep the buildings out of the shot but crouching down a little more and also doing a little cropping on the bottom', '2011-04-27 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
