(6397396, 948261, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I would recommend less light on the white bear because it''s too washed out.  This can be accomplished by using two lights on your studio 45 degree left and right of camera, then turn down the power on the one camera left.  Sorry, I''m a very technical person...  =)</td>', 'Great idea!  I would recommend less light on the white bear because it''s too washed out.  This can be accomplished by using two lights on your studio 45 degree left and right of camera, then turn down the power on the one camera left.  Sorry, I''m a very technical person...  =)', '2011-04-27 18:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
