(6400321, 947578, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you mean the pride of a gardener over their carefully tended garden with this shot? Good idea generally, although I think it would''ve worked better if an entire pretty garden were in view, as I think the image as it is may be too subtle for such a subtle idea.</td>', 'I''m guessing you mean the pride of a gardener over their carefully tended garden with this shot? Good idea generally, although I think it would''ve worked better if an entire pretty garden were in view, as I think the image as it is may be too subtle for such a subtle idea.', '2011-05-01 16:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
