(6400334, 947677, 94265, '<td valign="top">I can think of two explanations here; 1, the animal was so lazy and slow it simply died through lack of looking after itself, in which case showing it lying outside somewhere might''ve made more sense; or 2, the person is a hunter and caught the animal because it was slothful. Either way, not sure the guy''s outfit works.</td>', 'I can think of two explanations here; 1, the animal was so lazy and slow it simply died through lack of looking after itself, in which case showing it lying outside somewhere might''ve made more sense; or 2, the person is a hunter and caught the animal because it was slothful. Either way, not sure the guy''s outfit works.', '2011-05-01 16:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
