(6401091, 947677, 63244, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love a man in PINK camo!!! :P I like the silhouette of the face a ''stache, but wish I could see a tiny bit more of the facial features. The brightness of the skull and the dark face are (IMHO) a bit too stark a contrast. :)</td>', 'Oh, I love a man in PINK camo!!! :P I like the silhouette of the face a ''stache, but wish I could see a tiny bit more of the facial features. The brightness of the skull and the dark face are (IMHO) a bit too stark a contrast. :)', '2011-05-02 02:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
