(6403606, 947232, 125659, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the great comments. I have to say, I am somewhat disappointed with my score. I thought for sure I would get at least a 6.0. I''m hoping the title wasn''t the reason I ended up getting the score I got. I think it makes sense, but to some maybe it doesn''t. Well, it is what it is. At least I didn''t end up with a 4 something.</td>', 'Thank you all for the great comments. I have to say, I am somewhat disappointed with my score. I thought for sure I would get at least a 6.0. I''m hoping the title wasn''t the reason I ended up getting the score I got. I think it makes sense, but to some maybe it doesn''t. Well, it is what it is. At least I didn''t end up with a 4 something.', '2011-05-04 02:18:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6403625, 948047, 108580, '<td valign="top">Congrats. What''s funniest is it was taken through a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/lens.php?LENS_ID=1121" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tokina AF 12-24mm f/4.0 AT-X Pro DX</a> and not a Nikkor :) (BTW I also have one of those excellent Tokina''s on my D90).</td>', 'Congrats. What''s funniest is it was taken through a Tokina AF 12-24mm f/4.0 AT-X Pro DX and not a Nikkor :) (BTW I also have one of those excellent Tokina''s on my D90).', '2011-05-04 02:33:54.000000', NULL, 0),
