(6403715, 948163, 69325, '<td valign="top">I think some things that would have made this score a little better:<br/> <br/>- a plain shirt or no shirt on the male, it never looks clean or professional when people have logo''d shirts on<br/> <br/>- the b/g is not too bad but could be less distracting, like maybe a bed with a white sheet as a backdrop behind it<br/> <br/>- just a touch more contrast on the b&amp;w tones<br/> <br/>nice work tho, I bet you had a hard time getting your husband to pose for this? ;)</td>', 'I think some things that would have made this score a little better: - a plain shirt or no shirt on the male, it never looks clean or professional when people have logo''d shirts on - the b/g is not too bad but could be less distracting, like maybe a bed with a white sheet as a backdrop behind it - just a touch more contrast on the b&w tones nice work tho, I bet you had a hard time getting your husband to pose for this? ;)', '2011-05-04 04:43:38.000000', NULL, 0),
