(6404082, 948230, 117474, '<td valign="top">Based on your last 10 challenge entries... it''s more likely that you ribbon than not :)<br/>Congrats on the yellow. Love the lighting on the background. Really draws the eye to the subject. <br/> <br/>Forgot to write this en Francais... and I''m too lazy to think about it right now. :)</td>', 'Based on your last 10 challenge entries... it''s more likely that you ribbon than not :)Congrats on the yellow. Love the lighting on the background. Really draws the eye to the subject.  Forgot to write this en Francais... and I''m too lazy to think about it right now. :)', '2011-05-04 12:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
